      "content": "ok i'll try the ibuprofen. how much should i take to actually make the swelling go away quickly? like can i just take a bunch to get ahead of it? also do i need to worry about that shortness of breath thing you mentioned, i've been feeling a little winded just walking to the kitchen today.",
